{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedRecording","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedRecording","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedInsertion","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.List.Range"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertWordRec_snd_content_nodup","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertWordRec_snd_content_nodup","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRecording.lean#L78-L83","doc":"**The recording timestamps are distinct.**  Injectivity of the standard\nfilling, in multiset form. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertWordRec_snd_content","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertWordRec_snd_content","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRecording.lean#L71-L76","doc":"**The recording tableau's timestamps are exactly `0, 1, …, |w|-1`.**  Its\nmultiset content is `List.range |w|`; each step index occurs exactly once. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertWordRecAux_content","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertWordRecAux_content","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRecording.lean#L56-L69","doc":"**Content of the recording fold.**  Folding the letters of `w` from step `s`\nadds the consecutive indices `s, s+1, …, s+|w|-1` (i.e. `List.range' s |w|`)\nto the recording content. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertRec_snd_content","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.insertRec_snd_content","kind":"theorem","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedRecording.lean#L29-L54","doc":"**One step contributes one timestamp.**  Appending step index `s` to a\nshape-aligned recording tableau `Q` adds exactly `{s}` to its multiset\ncontent, in every insertion branch (base new-row, no-bump append, and\nbump-recursion). ","signatureChunk":0}]}